{"id":18742,"date":"2024-12-08T15:24:33","date_gmt":"2024-12-08T15:24:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18742"},"modified":"2026-06-04T19:28:05","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T19:28:05","slug":"jammin-djs-leadership","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/jammin-djs-leadership\/","title":{"rendered":"Leadership"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\n\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/lindsay-murray-COO-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"lindsay-murray-COO\" itemprop=\"image\" height=\"2560\" width=\"1920\" title=\"lindsay-murray-COO\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n\t<h2>Lindsay Murray<\/h2>\n<h4>COO Infinity Entertainment<\/h4>\n\t<h2>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs Leadership<\/h2>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs leadership is built around operational excellence, client service, team development, and a commitment to creating memorable entertainment experiences. Lindsay Murray has played a major role in that growth since joining JAMMIN&#8217; DJs and Infinity Entertainment in 2011.<\/p>\n<p>Lindsay brought a strong background in banking, retail, and hospitality to the company. Because of that experience, she quickly understood the importance of clear communication, organized systems, strong client relationships, and dependable event logistics.<\/p>\n<h3>Lindsay Murray&#8217;s Role at JAMMIN&#8217; DJs<\/h3>\n<p>Lindsay began her time with JAMMIN&#8217; DJs as Office Manager. In that role, she helped strengthen the company&#8217;s operational framework and improve the way the team handled logistics, staffing, scheduling, and client support.<\/p>\n<p>Her ability to streamline processes, solve problems, and drive results helped create a stronger foundation for the company. Over time, that foundation supported better communication, smoother events, and a more consistent client experience.<\/p>\n<h3>Operations, Staffing &amp; Team Development<\/h3>\n<p>Lindsay&#8217;s experience in human resources has also shaped the company&#8217;s culture and workforce. She has led important work in staff recruitment, onboarding, training, and professional development.<\/p>\n<p>In addition, she helped create operational policies that improved accountability, compliance, productivity, and team performance. These efforts helped JAMMIN&#8217; DJs build a more organized and reliable entertainment team for weddings, mitzvahs, school events, corporate events, private parties, and large productions.<\/p>\n<h3>Financial Leadership &amp; Long-Term Growth<\/h3>\n<p>With experience in banking and retail, Lindsay brought a practical and strategic approach to financial management. She helped modernize systems related to payroll, tax compliance, reporting, and long-term planning.<\/p>\n<p>As a result, the company strengthened its financial operations and created a more scalable foundation for future growth. Her leadership helped support smarter planning, stronger internal systems, and a more sustainable path forward.<\/p>\n<h3>Partner, Owner &amp; Chief Operating Officer<\/h3>\n<p>In 2015, Lindsay became a partner in JAMMIN&#8217; DJs. Her dedication, leadership, and ability to improve operations helped the company expand its services, strengthen its reputation, and raise the level of service delivered to clients.<\/p>\n<p>In 2024, Lindsay acquired majority ownership and was appointed Chief Operating Officer of Infinity Entertainment, DBA JAMMIN&#8217; DJs. Today, she helps guide the company&#8217;s strategic vision while continuing to focus on client satisfaction, operational consistency, financial stewardship, and long-term growth.<\/p>\n<h3>A Woman-Owned Entertainment Company<\/h3>\n<p>As a proudly woman-owned business, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs and Infinity Entertainment continue to grow with a focus on innovation, professionalism, and service. Under Lindsay&#8217;s leadership, the company is building a scalable model designed to support clients, team members, franchisees, and future partners.<\/p>\n<p>Her leadership combines practical operations, people-first management, financial discipline, and a clear commitment to creating better event experiences. With that direction, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs is positioned to continue growing as a trusted entertainment brand for weddings, mitzvahs, schools, corporate events, private parties, and large-scale celebrations.<\/p>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lindsay Murray COO Infinity Entertainment JAMMIN&#8217; DJs Leadership JAMMIN&#8217; DJs leadership is built around operational excellence, client service, team development, and a commitment to creating memorable entertainment experiences. Lindsay Murray has played a major role in that growth since joining JAMMIN&#8217; DJs and Infinity Entertainment in 2011. Lindsay brought a strong background in banking, retail,&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18742","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs Leadership | Lindsay Murray<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn about JAMMIN\u2019 DJs leadership and Lindsay Murray\u2019s role in operations, client service, team development, and company growth.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/jammin-djs-leadership\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Leadership\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn about JAMMIN\u2019 DJs leadership and Lindsay Murray\u2019s role 